---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Halloween Fest — Branding e Identidad Visual · Ascndr Jaén"
  description="Diseño de identidad visual completa para Halloween Fest Jaén: logo, carteles, pulseras VIP, acreditaciones y dirección creativa del evento. Proyecto de branding por Ascndr, estudio creativo en Jaén."
  canonical="https://ascndrworld.com/trabajos/branding/halloweenfest"
>

<style is:global>
  @import "../../../styles/global.css";

  body { background: #0a0a0a; }

  .pp {
    background: #0a0a0a;
    color: #f0ece6;
    min-height: 100vh;
    font-family: "Montserrat", sans-serif;
  }

  /* ── NAV ── */
  .pp-nav {
    position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 20px 32px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(10,10,10,.96) 0%, transparent 100%);
  }
  .pp-nav a {
    color: #666; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .14em;
    text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none;
    transition: color .2s;
  }
  .pp-nav a:hover { color: #f0ece6; }
  .pp-nav .pp-nav-logo { color: #f0ece6; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .1em; }

  /* ── HEADER igual que gallery-header ── */
  .pp-header {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 88px 32px 24px;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid #1e1e1e;
  }
  .pp-title {
    font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: .06em;
    color: #f0ece6; text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .pp-title em { color: #555; font-style: normal; }

  /* ── META ── */
  .pp-meta {
    display: flex; gap: 0;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid #1e1e1e;
  }
  .pp-meta-item {
    flex: 1; padding: 18px 32px;
    border-right: 0.5px solid #1e1e1e;
  }
  .pp-meta-item:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .pp-meta-label {
    font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #444; margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .pp-meta-value {
    font-size: 12px; color: #f0ece6; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .02em;
  }

  /* ── DESC ── */
  .pp-desc {
    padding: 36px 32px 40px;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid #1e1e1e;
    max-width: 720px;
  }
  .pp-desc p {
    font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.85; color: #888;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── GALERÍA — mismo estilo que gallery-grid ── */
  .pp-gallery {
    padding: 3px;
  }
  .pp-gallery-wide {
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 3px;
  }
  .pp-gallery-wide img {
    width: 100%; height: 70vh; min-height: 320px;
    object-fit: cover; display: block;
  }
  .pp-gallery-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 3px;
  }
  .pp-gallery-grid img {
    width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 3/4;
    object-fit: cover; display: block;
    transition: filter .3s ease;
  }
  .pp-gallery-grid img:hover { filter: brightness(1.08); }

  /* ── CTA ── */
  .pp-cta {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 32px;
    border-top: 0.5px solid #1e1e1e;
    margin-top: 3px;
  }
  .pp-cta-text { font-size: 11px; color: #444; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .pp-cta-btn {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    background: #141414; border: 0.5px solid #2a2a2a;
    border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 22px;
    color: #f0ece6; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .12em;
    text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none;
    font-family: "Montserrat", sans-serif;
    transition: border-color .2s;
  }
  .pp-cta-btn:hover { border-color: #c8753a; }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .pp-nav { padding: 16px 20px; }
    .pp-header { padding: 76px 20px 20px; }
    .pp-meta { flex-direction: column; }
    .pp-meta-item { border-right: none; border-bottom: 0.5px solid #1e1e1e; padding: 14px 20px; }
    .pp-meta-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .pp-desc { padding: 28px 20px; }
    .pp-gallery { padding: 2px; }
    .pp-gallery-wide img { height: 50vw; min-height: 200px; }
    .pp-gallery-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2px; }
    .pp-gallery-wide { margin-bottom: 2px; }
    .pp-cta { flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start; padding: 24px 20px; }
  }
</style>

<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{`
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "CreativeWork",
  "name": "Halloween Fest — Branding e Identidad Visual",
  "description": "Diseño de identidad visual completa para Halloween Fest Jaén: logo, carteles, pulseras VIP, acreditaciones y dirección creativa del evento durante dos ediciones consecutivas.",
  "creator": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "Ascndr", "url": "https://ascndrworld.com" },
  "url": "https://ascndrworld.com/trabajos/branding/halloweenfest",
  "image": "https://ascndrworld.com/images/halloween-fest/pulsera-portada.jpg",
  "keywords": ["branding", "identidad visual", "evento", "Halloween", "Jaén", "diseño gráfico"],
  "locationCreated": { "@type": "Place", "name": "Jaén, España" },
  "dateCreated": "2024",
  "genre": "Branding · Identidad Visual · Evento"
}
`}</script>

<div class="pp">

  <nav class="pp-nav">
    <a href="/trabajos">← Trabajos</a>
    <a href="/" class="pp-nav-logo">Ascndr</a>
    <a href="/">Contacto</a>
  </nav>

  <!-- Header estilo galería -->
  <div class="pp-header">
    <span class="pp-title">Halloween Fest <em>· Branding</em></span>
  </div>

  <!-- Metadatos -->
  <div class="pp-meta">
    <div class="pp-meta-item">
      <div class="pp-meta-label">Categoría</div>
      <div class="pp-meta-value">Branding · Evento</div>
    </div>
    <div class="pp-meta-item">
      <div class="pp-meta-label">Año</div>
      <div class="pp-meta-value">MMXXIV — MMXXV</div>
    </div>
    <div class="pp-meta-item">
      <div class="pp-meta-label">Cliente</div>
      <div class="pp-meta-value">Halloween Fest Jaén</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Descripción -->
  <div class="pp-desc">
    <p>Diseño de identidad visual completa para Halloween Fest, el evento de referencia de la noche de Halloween en Jaén. Dos ediciones consecutivas con dirección creativa integral: logo, carteles, pulseras VIP, acreditaciones y todos los materiales gráficos del evento.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Galería -->
  <div class="pp-gallery">
    <div class="pp-gallery-wide">
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/pulsera-portada.jpg" alt="Halloween Fest Jaén — Branding e identidad visual por Ascndr" fetchpriority="high"/>
    </div>
    <div class="pp-gallery-grid">
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/tickets.jpg" alt="Tickets Halloween Fest Jaén — branding Ascndr" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/cartel-oficial.jpg" alt="Cartel oficial Halloween Fest Jaén — diseño Ascndr" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/cartel-3-0.jpg" alt="Cartel 3ª edición Halloween Fest Jaén — Ascndr" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/acreditacion.jpg" alt="Acreditación Halloween Fest Jaén — diseño gráfico Ascndr" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/pulseras.jpg" alt="Pulseras VIP Halloween Fest Jaén — identidad visual Ascndr" loading="lazy"/>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <div class="pp-cta">
    <span class="pp-cta-text">¿Tienes un proyecto similar?</span>
    <a href="/" class="pp-cta-btn">Hablemos →</a>
  </div>

</div>

</Layout>
